nd and Norway. In December 1944 the division was transformed into the 101st Guards Rifle Division.","LocalizedString":"The 95th Rifle Regiment was attached to the 14th Rifle Division of the Red Army which was formed in 1922 in Moscow. During WWII the division saw combat in Operation Silver Fox in 1941, which was a German-Finnish offensive with the objective of capturing the Soviet port at Murmansk, and later it took part in the Petsamo-Kirkenes Offensive in 1944 where the Red Army defeated the Wehrmacht's forces in the Arctic of Northern Finland and Norway. In December 1944 the division was transformed into the 101st Guards Rifle Division."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isReserved":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment"],"hasDeployment":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Small'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Small.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/t_soviet_inf.t_soviet_inf","SubPathString":""},"artist":"World History Archive / Alamy Stock Photo","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/95th_RIFLE_REGIMENT.95th_RIFLE_REGIMENT","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":351.0},"historyPhotoSource":"Wikipedia.org","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_95th_rifles_photo","SourceString":"Red Army landing party heading for Kirkenes in 1944.","LocalizedString":"Red Army landing party heading for Kirkenes in 1944."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_95th_rifles_header","SourceString":"Infantry","LocalizedString":"Infantry"},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryL'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Niagara/NS_ExplosionInfantryL.47"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeMedium_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/ex